{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18806","headline":"早夏郡中书事 · 刘禹锡","name":"早夏郡中书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水禽渡残月，飞雨洒高城。\n华堂对嘉树，帘庑含晓清。\n拂镜整危冠，振衣步前楹。\n将吏俨成列，簿书纷来萦。\n言下辨曲直，笔端破交争。\n虚怀询病苦，怀律操剽轻。\n阍吏告无事，归来解簪缨。\n高帘覆朱阁，忽尔闻调笙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}